    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 50 minutes from start to table. Watch the initial browning: the chicken skin needs to be deeply golden before the wine goes in, otherwise you get pale results and a thin sauce."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bone-in chicken thighs work best here. They stay moist through the long braise and add gelatin to the sauce that breasts simply cannot."
          }
        ]
      },
